OL,3,GNEWSASalmond asked top law officer
OL,4,Aabout pardon for William Wallace
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Lord Advocate has revealed
OL,7,FAlex Salmond once asked him to
OL,8,Finvestigate a pardon for the medieval
OL,9,FScottish knight, William Wallace.
OL,11,FLord Mulholland, who served as
OL,12,FScotland's top law officer from 2011 to
OL,13,F2016, said he was unsure whether the
OL,14,Flate first minister's request was
OL,15,Fserious, adding the conversation was
OL,16,F"humorous" and did not lead to any
OL,17,Fformal action.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
