OL,3,GNEWSASalmond asked top law officer
OL,4,Aabout pardon for William Wallace
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was giving evidence to a committee
OL,7,Fof MPs investigating the dual role of
OL,8,Fthe Lord Advocate, who leads Scotland's
OL,9,Fprosecution service and sits in the
OL,10,FScottish cabinet.
OL,12,FThe committee is holding an inquiry
OL,13,Finto the case of Peter Murrell, the
OL,14,Fformer SNP chief executive convicted of
OL,15,Fembezzlement.
